Already fixed in commit bc353f02c0. The code now uses a local variable `staggerRefresh` instead of mutating `meta.stagger_refresh`:

```typescript
// Normalize stagger_refresh to boolean without mutating state
let staggerRefresh: boolean;
if (typeof meta.stagger_refresh === 'boolean') {
  staggerRefresh = meta.stagger_refresh;
} else {
  staggerRefresh = meta.stagger_refresh === undefined
    ? true
    : meta.stagger_refresh === 'true';
}
```

