The component docs say it "Uses colorTextLabel for consistent icon color", but the implementation never sets icon/button color (it relies on inherited styling). This makes the color dependent on surrounding styles and can reintroduce the inconsistency this PR is trying to fix. Consider applying the intended token explicitly (e.g., via `iconColor` on the default icon or a default `buttonCss` that sets `color`), and update the docstring accordingly.
