This follows the same pattern used in the regular Table plugin (`transformProps.ts:475-479`):

```typescript
const formData = merge(
  {},
  originalFormData,
  originalFormData.extra_form_data,
);
```

The duplication is intentional - it allows `extra_form_data` properties (dashboard-level overrides) to take precedence over chart-level settings while preserving the original structure. This pattern was introduced in PRs #33947 and #34014 for the regular Table plugin, and we're following the same approach here for consistency.

