**Suggestion:** When the screenshot/PDF download promise rejects (for example, if DOM-to-image fails), the dropdown overlay container's visibility is set to hidden and never restored, leaving the download menu permanently invisible; wrapping the handler call in a Promise and restoring visibility in a finally block ensures the overlay is always made visible again on both success and failure. [logic error]

