`src/pages/UserInfo/index.tsx:223-249` renders `<ApiKeyList />` under
`FeatureFlag.FabApiKeyEnabled`.

2. In `src/features/apiKeys/ApiKeyList.tsx:223-233`, click "Create API Key" (`line 212`)
so `<ApiKeyCreateModal />` mounts conditionally via `showCreateModal && ...`.

3. Create a key, then click "Copy" in `src/features/apiKeys/ApiKeyCreateModal.tsx:71-79`;
this schedules `setTimeout(() => setCopied(false), 2000)` at `line 78`.

4. Close modal immediately ("Done"/hide path): `handleClose` at
`ApiKeyCreateModal.tsx:84-91` calls `onHide`, parent sets `setShowCreateModal(false)`
(`ApiKeyList.tsx:226-228`) and unmounts modal (`line 223` condition false); pending timer
still fires later and performs stale `setCopied(false)` against unmounted instance.
Repeated copy clicks within 2s also leave multiple timers, causing premature copied-state
reset races.
